{"id":929707,"title":"直播回放｜智能体与工作流调试答疑","content":"<p>本次直播收集了用户们课程中的疑难问题进行答疑，并展示了智能体的前沿应用方法（如构建视频生成工作流）。</p><p><video poster=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/007d8c2fd02c71f0bfb24531959c0102/snapshots/8a4324a920a144da96261ba71d9c8627-00005.jpg\" preload=\"none\" controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://media001.geekbang.org/customerTrans/7e27d07d27d407ebcc195a0e78395f55/16e22619-19ae396388d-0000-0000-01d-dbacd.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"><source src=\" https://media001.geekbang.org/700c3a60d03071f08a936723a78f0402/3d256a3fa73c48fe91fff00394a95457-1baca9a1065d8a65b7561f535b53e1bd-sd.m3u8\" type=\"application/x-mpegURL\"></video></p><h1>你将获得</h1><ul>\n<li>如何快速构建 AI 智能体</li>\n<li>AI 工作流编排思路详解</li>\n<li>智能体开发前沿案例分享</li>\n<li>课程疑难问题答疑</li>\n</ul><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[]}